### S3Client with endpoint, forcePathStyle, credentials, requestHandler, httpsAgent, maxAttempts

Source: https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-js-v3/blob/main/private/aws-client-api-test/src/client-interface-tests/client-s3/impl/initializeWithMaximalConfiguration.ts

Maximal S3Client configuration demonstrating custom endpoint, forcePathStyle, credentials, NodeHttpHandler with https.Agent, and maxAttempts.

```typescript
const config: Required<S3ClientConfigType> = {
  region: loadNodeConfig(NODE_REGION_CONFIG_OPTIONS, NODE_REGION_CONFIG_FILE_OPTIONS),
  credentials: defaultProvider({}),
  endpoint: "endpoint",
  requestHandler: new NodeHttpHandler({
    httpsAgent: new https.Agent({
      maxSockets: 200,
      keepAlive: true,
    }),
    requestTimeout: 15000,
    connectionTimeout: 6000,
  }),
  maxAttempts: loadNodeConfig(NODE_MAX_ATTEMPT_CONFIG_OPTIONS),
  forcePathStyle: false,
};
const s3 = new S3Client(config);
```

