### Instantiate S3RequestPresigner from existing S3Client config

Source: https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-js-v3/blob/main/packages/s3-request-presigner/README.md

Spreads configuration from an existing S3Client instance to avoid passing redundant construction parameters.

```javascript
//s3 is instantiated from S3Client from @aws-sdk/client-s3-* packages
const signer = new S3RequestPresigner({
  ...s3.config,
});
```

### Service-specific constructor parameters > S3 > `requestChecksumCalculation` and `responseChecksumValidation`:

Source: https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-js-v3/blob/main/supplemental-docs/CLIENTS.md

These may be set to `WHEN_REQUIRED` or `WHEN_SUPPORTED`. See https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-js-v3/issues/6810.

